{"_id":"6616eb55128b9d6567f7339a","title":"Find Kiras and TP to ids","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77fd1","gameId":5134682719,"name":"[🌴] DEATH NOTE","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c47249b767193d459be1f6e062b32bb7ed95092a3a3c1817dbfdbbaa917c4056.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4853cc9bdb14323fd305cf0443089cbc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"5134682719-death-note","path":"/game/5134682719-death-note","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c47249b767193d459be1f6e062b32bb7ed95092a3a3c1817dbfdbbaa917c4056.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4853cc9bdb14323fd305cf0443089cbc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":5134682719},"slug":"DEATH-NOTE-Find-Kiras-and-TP-to-ids-12305","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":45691,"executes":687,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6547f41ae863de333647fb806e0baea9835a4cfa4985b4390a4550872f8d1af2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/5134682719-1712778069853.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/5134682719-1712778069853.webp"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6547f41ae863de333647fb806e0baea9835a4cfa4985b4390a4550872f8d1af2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/5134682719-1712778069853.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/5134682719-1712778069853.webp"},"likeCount":9,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2024-04-10T19:41:09.889Z","updatedAt":"2024-04-10T19:41:09.889Z","lastBump":"2024-04-10T19:41:09.889Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/9CCnnTzR\"))()\n\n\n\n------- below is a standalone script i didnt bother including in the pastebin\n------- USE IT TO AUTOPICK ALL IDS (dont use this or autosearch while noclipped you'll die)\n\n----\nlocal Client = game.Players.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal function FillStashList()\n\tlocal StashList = {}\n\tfor _, v in workspace.Map:GetChildren() do\n\t\tif v.Name == \"Id\" then\n\t\t\ttable.insert(StashList, v)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\t\n\treturn StashList\nend\n\n\nlocal function FiddleWIthPrompts()\n\tfor _, v in workspace.Map:GetChildren() do\n\t\tif v.Name == \"Id\" then\n\t\t\tv.IdPrompt.HoldDuration = 0\n\t\t\tv.IdPrompt.MaxActivationDistance = 100000\n\t\t\tv.IdPrompt.RequiresLineOfSight = false\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\n\n\nlocal function AutoSearch(StashList)\n\tif workspace.Map ~= nil then\n\t\tFiddleWIthPrompts()\n\t\tfor _, crate in pairs(StashList) do\n\t\t\tClient.Character.HumanoidRootPart.CFrame = crate.CFrame * CFrame.new(Vector3.new(0,1,0))\n\t\t\tkeypress(0x45)\n\t\t\ttask.wait(0.2)\n\t\t\tkeyrelease(0x45)\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\nend\n\n\n\nAutoSearch(FillStashList())\n\t------","features":"Press \"Start\" when a round start (when you're in the map)\nInput a player name in cmd bar to teleport to their id\nall commands are on the settings tab\nfiddleids and fiddlescrates make it much easier to pick ids and search for death note. Use when you're in the map.\n\n\njump on teleport to avoid buggin","tags":["death note","deathnote","dn","kira","ID"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6609802a4f9bea9617c48d0b","username":"stchroma","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f3d569b924cdd2d13ca48761ce4367831f6c42cfe08d15c5e954435ef625bb57.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6609802a4f9bea9617c48d0b-1711898800525.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6609802a4f9bea9617c48d0b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f3d569b924cdd2d13ca48761ce4367831f6c42cfe08d15c5e954435ef625bb57.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6609802a4f9bea9617c48d0b-1711898800525.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T03:22:08.345Z","last":"","win":1